{"id":"truco","lemma":"truco","pos":"noun","rank":1321,"glosses":["gimmick, ploy (something designed to fool or swindle)","piece of a magician's act","effective way of doing something"],"ipa":"/ˈtɾuko/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"trucos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a6/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-truco.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Dónde está el truco?","en":"Where's the catch?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/75838","words":[null,null,{"g":"the"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"where are you?"]]},{"text":"Ese truco yo no lo sabía.","en":"I didn't know that trick.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/531849","words":[{"g":"that"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"}]},{"text":"Mi primo es bueno haciendo trucos de magia.","en":"My cousin is good at doing magic tricks.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"first"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"good"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"magic"}]},{"text":"No es un truco.","en":"It's not a trick.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77631","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Tom sabe unos cuantos trucos de magia.","en":"Tom knows a few magic tricks.","words":[null,{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},null,null,null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"magic"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"a few"]]}]}